    {
      "t": "texte",
      "html": "Chers parents,<br><br>\nL'application <b>Team Lausanne Academy</b> est disponible dès aujourd'hui sur l'App Store et sur Google Play.<br><br>\nLes cours de vos enfants, les absences, le calendrier de la saison, les stages et les nouvelles du club : tout ce qu'il faut savoir est désormais au même endroit, toujours à jour. Téléchargez-la dès maintenant et simplifiez-vous la saison.",
      "align": "left"
    },
    {
      "t": "texte",
      "align": "center",
      "html": "<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#04205e\" style=\"background:#04205e;border-radius:18px\">\n<tr><td style=\"padding:26px 22px 8px\" align=\"center\">\n  <table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tr>\n    <td valign=\"middle\" style=\"padding-right:14px\"><img src=\"https://app.teamlausanne.ch/assets/newsletter/app-icone.png\" alt=\"Icône de l'app Team Lausanne Academy\" width=\"60\" style=\"display:block;width:60px;height:60px;border:0;border-radius:14px\" /></td>\n    <td valign=\"middle\" align=\"left\" style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#ffffff\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px;color:#b2fd13\">DISPONIBLE MAINTENANT</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.25;margin-top:4px\">Team Lausanne Academy</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#b8c6ec;margin-top:2px\">iPhone · Android</div>\n    </td></tr></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:14px 16px 26px\" align=\"center\">\n  <table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tr>\n    <td style=\"padding:6px\"><a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/id6823676524\" style=\"text-decoration:none\"><img src=\"https://app.teamlausanne.ch/assets/newsletter/badge-app-store.png\" alt=\"Télécharger dans l'App Store\" width=\"200\" style=\"display:block;width:200px;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0\" /></a></td>\n    <td style=\"padding:6px\"><a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=ch.teamlausanne.app\" style=\"text-decoration:none\"><img src=\"https://app.teamlausanne.ch/assets/newsletter/badge-google-play.png\" alt=\"Disponible sur Google Play\" width=\"200\" style=\"display:block;width:200px;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0\" /></a></td>\n  </tr></table>\n</td></tr></table>"
    },
    {
      "t": "texte",
      "html": "<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tr><td width=\"32%\" valign=\"top\" align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#073eb5\" style=\"background:#073eb5;border-radius:16px;padding:18px 8px 16px\"><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:46px;line-height:1;font-weight:800;color:#b2fd13\">6</div>\n  <div style=\"width:26px;height:3px;background:#5d7fd6;margin:10px auto;font-size:0;line-height:0\">&nbsp;</div>\n  <div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:600;color:#ffffff\">onglets simples</div></td><td width=\"8\" style=\"width:8px;font-size:0;line-height:0\">&nbsp;</td><td width=\"32%\" valign=\"top\" align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#073eb5\" style=\"background:#073eb5;border-radius:16px;padding:18px 8px 16px\"><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:46px;line-height:1;font-weight:800;color:#b2fd13\">2</div>\n  <div style=\"width:26px;height:3px;background:#5d7fd6;margin:10px auto;font-size:0;line-height:0\">&nbsp;</div>\n  <div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:600;color:#ffffff\">touches pour une absence</div></td><td width=\"8\" style=\"width:8px;font-size:0;line-height:0\">&nbsp;</td><td width=\"32%\" valign=\"top\" align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#073eb5\" style=\"background:#073eb5;border-radius:16px;padding:18px 8px 16px\"><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:46px;line-height:1;font-weight:800;color:#b2fd13\">1</div>\n  <div style=\"width:26px;height:3px;background:#5d7fd6;margin:10px auto;font-size:0;line-height:0\">&nbsp;</div>\n  <div style=\"font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:600;color:#ffffff\">accès pour toute la famille</div></td></tr></table>"
